# ── 探针本地运行产物(临时日志/容器卷;curated 结果可手动 git add -f)──
/docs/engineering/probe-results/*.log
/docs/engineering/probe-results/tmp/
/docs/engineering/probe-results/**/*.tmp
/scripts/probes/runtime/

# ── 机密:只允许来自环境变量或未跟踪文件,绝不进仓库 ──
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*secret*
credentials*
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub

